At 18 weeks after the lesion, 28/36 traced severed ends showed new growth (
Figures S9C and S10
). That growth ranged from 12 – 877 μm with a mean of 182 μm. Of the 28 severed ends of axons that showed new growth, 7 were able to traverse the stab rift completely and emerge on the other side.
